# Core Python environment of the agent image (Python 3.12, linux/aarch64). Top-level requirements ONLY; the full hash-locked closure is core.lock.txt.
# Every package here resolved TOGETHER from real PyPI metadata (scripts/lock-container-python.sh). Tools that cannot be resolved as wheels for this
# platform/Python, or that only support older Python, are NOT here and NOT silently dropped: they live in optional.in (separate venv, separate image).
